    <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2/DistributionShape#dct:description>, <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2/DistributionShape#foaf:page>,
    <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2/DistributionShape#dcat:downloadURL>, <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2/DistributionShape#dct:format>,
